      "To design a conditional payment: open 'Payment Rule Designer', fill Pay to / Amount / Trigger type / Condition (and optional Purpose-bind), then click 'Save rule' - it prints a plain-English sentence and a copyable JSON spec (use the 'Copy' button).",
