      "Fix categories: click the coloured category tag on any row to change it, or tick several rows and use the floating bar at the bottom to bulk-tag them; if all ticked rows share one counterparty, click + Create rule so that vendor is auto-categorised forever.",
      "Tap Scan receipt to photograph a bill - Claude reads the vendor, amount and date and drops a pre-filled transaction in for you to review.",
      "Click Reconcile or the Bank Recon button to match your records against the bank statement, and watch the intelligence cards up top for Potential Duplicates and Category Spend Spike warnings.",
