      "Treat the four intelligence cards as a free controller - the Spend Velocity and Category Spike cards catch runaway costs before month-end, and Potential Duplicates catches double-paid vendors you can claw back.",
      "Post your Opening Balances and any Manual Journals first, then the Trial Balance and Day Book actually tie out - export the cleaned list as CSV and hand it straight to your CA at filing time.",
      "Use the PDC Register and Bounce Tracker together: log every customer cheque as a receivable PDC, and the moment one bounces, record it so you have the dated paper trail needed for a Section 138 notice."
