      "Always run a supplier invoice through '3-Way Match' (PO qty/rate vs goods received vs invoice) before scheduling payment - it surfaces over-billed exposure in rupees so you stop overpaying.",
      "If you buy from registered MSME/Udyam suppliers, schedule their payables and watch the 'MSME 45-Day' and 'MSME Interest 43B(h)' tabs - paying late triggers 3x bank-rate compound interest and ITR disclosure.",
      "Pair Schedule + AP Aging with the Cashflow/Forecast feature: scheduled payments feed your runway, so you can time large vendor payouts for weeks when cash is strong."
