      "Text plain-English questions, not just commands - anything beyond the fixed keywords is answered by an AI CFO using your actual numbers (e.g. 'Should I take the credit offer?', 'Why is my burn so high?').",
      "Chain the tools: send an invoice with a UPI pay-link via Invoice & Pay, then if it goes unpaid let Reminder Bot escalate it automatically - both pull the same invoice data.",
      "Set up Quick Replies snippets and a Chat Link / QR for your shop counter so staff can send consistent, on-brand replies and customers can start a chat in one tap."
